WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.534
The virus is really hitting

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.536
all of China at once.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.107
The forecast for deaths
in China reach as high as

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:18.051
China's road to reopening
is a little bit like

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.819
that Ernest Hemingway phrase:

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.955
Gradually, and then suddenly.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:24.090
The pressure has really
been building for a year now

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.492
since the arrival of Omicron

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:28.194
because that variant is
just so transmissible

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:31.698
that China's classic playbook
of lockdowns, mass testing

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:34.901
was becoming less and less
effective against stopping spread.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.470
Then there were these
unprecedented protests

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.938 position:58%
that happened at the end of November.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.273
People taking to the streets,

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:43.143
some even calling for
president Xi to step down.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.612
Since then, China has
basically let it rip.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:48.114
All of these measures
now have been overturned.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.383 position:63%
The only thing that remains for China is

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:54.120
these travel curbs that we expect
to be eased quite soon as well.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.255
What we're seeing right now

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:57.457
is that really initial stage
of infection that we saw

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:00.460 position:63%
in so many other countries in early 2020

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.529 position:58%
where suddenly over a couple of days,

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.898 position:59%
almost everybody you know is infected.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:08.034
What's really worrisome
coming after this stage

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:10.937
is when serious illness
and fatalities will set in.

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.106
There's a lot of concern
over how the elderly

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.941
especially are under vaccinated

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.743
and they're vaccinated
with Chinese vaccines,

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.646
which we know are not as
effective as the western mRNAs.

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:21.548
The health system is under strain.

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:22.749
Officials are telling people,

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.284
please don't come to the hospitals

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.885
unless you're seriously sick.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.188
They're trying to prioritize
the most vulnerable.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:31.191
The virus is really hitting
all of China at once.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.692
I think we can see the same thing

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:34.227
really happen in all major cities

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:39.227
The virus is really hitting
all of China at once.

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:44.737
But as we've seen in so many
other countries around the world,

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:46.206
the waves keep coming back.

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:49.742
There may be another variant,
which is a really big unknown

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.411 position:61%
that experts are quite concerned about.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:53.513
Because you're talking about
1.4 billion people.

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:54.948
The more people get the virus,

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.485
the more it evolves.

